  "title": "Immersive Melodies in Backpacks",
  "description": "Play Immersive Melodies instruments from your Sophisticated Backpacks or Traveler's Backpack jukebox upgrade. Built-in song picker with shuffle, repeat, and page organization. Works just like a regular song playlist!",
  "body": "# Immersive Melodies in Backpacks\n\nForge 1.20.1 mod that lets you put [Immersive Melodies](https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-melodies) instruments into the Jukebox upgrade slot of [Sophisticated Backpacks](https://modrinth.com/mod/sophisticated-backpacks) or [Traveler's Backpack](https://modrinth.com/mod/travelersbackpack), then interact with songs through a small in-GUI picker like a regular playlist of songs.\n\n## Requirements\n\n* Minecraft 1.20.1\n* Forge 47+\n* Immersive Melodies 0.5.0+\n* At least one of:\n    * Sophisticated Backpacks 3.24.0+ (with Sophisticated Core 1.3.0+)\n    * Traveler's Backpack 9.1.0+\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Install a Jukebox upgrade in your backpack.\n2. Drop an Immersive Melodies instrument into the jukebox disc slot.\n3. Open the picker, choose a melody, press play.\n4. Shuffle and repeat work the same way they do for music discs. Interactions with the song picker function the same as a regular song playlist.\n\n## License\n\nMIT",
